  "name": "1.1 “Cash Management Account”",
  "text": "“Cash Management Account” has the meaning set forth in Section 2.6."
},
{
  "id": "c042",
  "name": "1.1 “Cash Management Agreements”",
  "text": "“Cash Management Agreements” means those certain cash management agreements, in form and substance satisfactory to Lender, each of which is among a Borrower or one of its Subsidiaries, Lender, and one of the Cash Management Banks."
},
{
  "id": "c043",
  "name": "1.1 “Cash Management Bank”",
